 abstract = {The agile method is a way of thinking and an approach that puts project collaboration on a new footing. The success of agile is hard to doubt, given the trends and fashions that have developed around it. However, understanding what makes agile projects successful, what factors influence it and how important they are to the participants is a much more complex issue. Agile places a strong emphasis on interaction and communication with each other, whether this is outside the team, but especially within the team, there are many different possibilities.},
