 abstract = {Digitization technology refers to the processing and storage of information by computer language, which includes words, graphics, colors, relationships, etc. The digitized information is stored and calculated, and displayed again in different forms. Most of the existing clothing design software is a subsystem of clothing CAD system, and its design method is mainly to use the mouse to replace the paintbrush or to use graphics processing software to process clothing photos, which lacks professional advantages and poor practicability. At present, in view of the disadvantages of most fashion design softwares, which focus on simple list of styles and interactive drawing functions, we put forward a digital fashion design system. The garment style can be automatically generated according to the user},
